TITLE: Letter from the Secretary of State for Education to the CEO of the Competition and Markets Authority
URL: https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/letter-from-the-secretary-of-state-for-education-to-the-ceo-of-the-competition-and-markets-authority
DATE: 2026-05-26
GOVUK_TYPE: correspondence
LINKED_SPEAKERS: The Rt Hon Bridget Phillipson MP

---

The Rt Hon Bridget Phillipson MP, Secretary of State for Education, wrote to Sarah Cardell, the chief executive of the Competition and Markets Authority (CMA) on 26 May 2026, requesting that the CMA conduct an independent review of the English early years childcare market.

Read the response to the Secretary of State’s letter from the CEO of CMA.